has numbers
Reverse Numbers
	ReverseList(1, 2, 3, 4).Reverse is (4, 3, 2, 1)
	for Range(0, numbers.Length).Reverse
		numbers(index)
Added(other Numbers) Numbers
	ReverseList(1, 2).Added((10, 20)) is (11, 22)
	(ReverseList(1, 2, 3).Added((10, 20)) to Text).StartsWith("(11, 22, Error: Added") is true
	for numbers
		value + other(index)